The [[Frozen Buckler]] is a [[Shield]] mainly obtained by combining the [[Wooden Buckler]] with a [[Snowball]], although it can also be obtained from the shop while playing [[Pyromancer]] with [[Frozen Flame]]. It's one of the most powerful small shields, sapping as much stamina as the large shields, while having the second-highest damage block among shields of its size (beaten only by the [[Adventurer]]-exclusive [[Hero Shield]]). It also inflicts {{icon/cold}}, up to 10.

